## 2 · Day timeline rail (time-of-day)

The one thing month/week/agenda can't show: **when** inside a day. A vertical hour axis for a
single day, events as blocks; overlaps sit side by side. A live "now" line.

```
  Thu Jun 18              ‹  Today  ›
  ─────────────────────────────────────
  08 │
  09 │ ▓▓ Standup (Eng)
  10 │ ▓▓▓▓ Vendor sync
  11 │
  12 │ ░░ Lunch hold
  13 │ ███ Design review ──┐
  14 │ ███                 │  side-by-side
  15 │     ▒▒ 1:1 Sara ────┘  on overlap
  16 │ ▓ Ship cutoff
  now━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━  ← 3 events left
  17 │
```

- **Fit:** tall + narrow (a sidebar rail). Scrolls vertically.
- **Needs:** a *time* component on the date value; date-only sources render as all-day chips pinned to the top.
- **Reuse:** new `DayRail` mode beside Month/Week/Agenda; same `CalendarEvent`/color/`onOpen`.

