## 3 · Continuous scroll (paging-free weeks)

Fantastical-style infinite list. Weeks stack vertically and you just scroll — no
prev/next chrome. Today is anchored and highlighted. Empty days collapse.

```
  ▼ This week
    Mon 15   • Kickoff   • Invoice #204 due
    Tue 16   —
  ◉ Wed 17   • Design review   • 1:1 Sara   +2
    Thu 18   • Ship cutoff
    Fri 19   • Retro
  ▼ Next week
    Mon 22   • Vendor onboarding
    Tue 23   • Board prep   +3
    Wed 24   • Webinar
            ⋮  scroll for more ⋮
```

- **Fit:** any height; shines tall + medium width. No header buttons to crowd small boxes.
- **Multi-source:** colored dots before each label (`•` carries the source color).
- **Reuse:** `agendaEvents` grouping logic, extended to render empty days + week dividers.

