## 4 · Mini-month + agenda (split)

A compact month *picker* drives a detail **agenda** beside it. Click a day → list filters to it.
Responsive: when the box narrows it drops the agenda and becomes a plain mini-month.

```
  ┌─ June 2026  ‹ › ─┐   ┌ Wed Jun 17 ──────────────┐
  │ M  T  W  T  F  S │   │ ● Design review     10:00 │
  │  ·  ·  ·  ·  ·  1│   │ ● 1:1 Sara          14:00 │
  │  2  3  4  5  6  7│   │ ● Invoice #204       due  │
  │  9 10 11 12 13 14│   ├ Thu Jun 18 ──────────────┤
  │ 16[17]18 19 20 21│   │ ● Ship cutoff             │
  │ 23 24 25 26 27 28│   │ ● Retro             16:00 │
  │ 30 ·  ·  ·  ·  · │   │                           │
  └──────────────────┘   └───────────────────────────┘
   ● = day has events      (selected day + look-ahead)
```

- **Fit:** wide + medium height. Collapses gracefully to just the month on narrow boxes.
- **Reuse:** literally Month grid (compacted, dots) + Agenda list side by side; a `selectedDay` state links them.

---

## 5 · Source swimlanes (compare across concepts)

Rotate the emphasis from *dates* to *sources*. One **lane per concept/source**, days across the
top, an event marker in the cell. Answers "which stream is busy this week" at a glance.

```
              Mon  Tue  Wed  Thu  Fri  Sat  Sun
              15   16   17   18   19   20   21
  Deals       ●          ●●         ●
  Tasks            ●     ●    ●●          ●
  Calendar    ●●   ●     ●●●  ●     ●
  Invoices               ●               ●    ●
              └──── today ────┘
  ● Deals   ● Tasks   ● Calendar   ● Invoices
```

- **Fit:** wide + short. Lane count = source count; scrolls if many.
- **Multi-source:** this is the *most* multi-source view — each row is one source, dot count = events that day.
- **Reuse:** `eventsByDay` partitioned by `source` instead of merged; week columns from `weekDays`.

---

### At a glance

| # | Direction          | Best box        | Key new need                  | Reuse level |
|---|--------------------|-----------------|-------------------------------|-------------|
| 1 | Activity heatmap   | short · wide    | count→intensity scale         | high        |
| 2 | Day timeline rail  | tall · narrow   | time-of-day on date value     | medium      |
| 3 | Continuous scroll  | tall · any      | render empty days + dividers  | high        |
| 4 | Mini-month + agenda| wide · medium   | linked `selectedDay` state    | very high   |
| 5 | Source swimlanes   | wide · short    | per-source partition of byDay | high        |
